           INFORMATION CONCERNING VALHALLA FROM VULCAN SOFTWARE!
 
     This game consists of 6 disks! The disks are labelled as follows:

                          Disk 1 - Valhalla Disk
                          Disk 2 - Data Disk
                          Disk 3 - Level 1
                          Disk 4 - Level 2 
                          Disk 5 - Level 3
                          Disk 6 - Level 4


                At the protection check you MUST type  COOL
 
On the Amiga 500 due to the lame code of the original it needs to be loaded
     via workbench! Or alternatively just type VALHALLA at the prompt!

     I hope these small points aid you in your enjoyment of this game!
